<title>SINGAPORE: Venture Manufacturing first half net up.</title>
<headline>Venture Manufacturing first half net up.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    15.16     vs    8.00</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	21.40     vs   11.50</p>
<p>    Turnover		     320.11     vs  105.28</p>
<p>    Interest income		0.71     vs    0.63</p>
<p>    Investment/other income    0.04     vs    nil</p>
<p>    Interest expense	     0.71     vs    0.37</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			 19.28     vs    9.13</p>
<p>    Tax				4.31     vs    1.20</p>
<p>    Minorities		     0.18     vs    0.07</p>
<p>note - Venture Manufacturing (Singapore) Ltd said it achieved better performance due to strong demand for its electronic products and services.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
